  "executive_briefing": "The legislative environment in the United States has reached a critical inflection point with the CLARITY Act nearing a Senate vote, providing the foundational regulatory guardrails necessary for institutional capital to treat Bitcoin as a definitive multi-asset reserve. This legislative certainty is catalyzing a shift in market structure, where Bitcoin is evolving from a passive treasury hedge into a programmable, multi-chain liquidity backbone. Concurrently, the proliferation of trustless cross-chain liquidity and native-swap protocols is effectively challenging the reliance on centralized bridges and wrapped assets, narrowing the functional gap between Bitcoin\u2019s burgeoning Layer-2 ecosystem and the established EVM DeFi infrastructure.",
